@startuml assistant-sequence
autonumber
actor Customer as "Customer"
participant Gateway as "Nginx Gateway\n(:80)"
participant IS as "integration-service\n(:8084)"
participant LLM as "Claude API\n(LLM Provider)"
participant PS as "parcel-service\n(:8082)"

Customer -> Gateway: POST /api/v1/assistant/chat\n{"message": "Where is my parcel SD-..."}\nAuthorization: Bearer <Customer-JWT>
Gateway -> IS: Forward request
IS -> IS: Validate JWT, check per-user rate limit & msg length <= 500
IS -> LLM: Prompt + Tool Definitions\n(get_parcel_status, estimate_fee, list_my_recent_parcels)
LLM --> IS: Request Tool Call: get_parcel_status(trackingNo: "SD-...")
IS -> PS: GET /api/v1/parcels/{id} (Bearer <Customer-JWT>)
note over IS, PS: Caller's own JWT token preserves permission isolation
PS --> IS: 200 OK (Parcel status, history)
IS -> LLM: Return Tool Output: { status: "OUT_FOR_DELIVERY", courier: "Nuwan" }
LLM --> IS: Return natural language answer
IS --> Customer: 200 OK {"reply": "Your parcel is currently Out for Delivery..."}
@enduml
